; Lambda is a simple (semi-)functional based-programming language.
; In lambda, we only have functions
; Let's look at how we can define a function
id → (λ x. x)
; This is the identity function.
; We assign a name to it with →
; All functions take the form λ (parameters). function body
succ → (λ x. (+ x 1))
; Lambda uses RPN for ease of compilation.

; What about multiple arguments?
add → (λ x y. (+ x y))
; 
;At the end of a program we must invoke a function.
(add 2 3) ;prints 5
